msgstr "espeak(1), उत्सव(1), mbrola(1), freetts(1)"

#: man-kmouth.1.docbook:61
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"More detailed user documentation is available from <ulink "
"url=\"help:/kmouth\">help:/kmouth</ulink> (either enter this &URL; into "
"&konqueror;, or run <userinput><command>khelpcenter</command> "
"<parameter>help:/kmouth</parameter></userinput>)."
msgstr ""
"अधिकविस्तृतं उपयोक्तृदस्तावेजं <ulink "
"url=\"help:/kmouth\">help:/kmouth</ulink> इत्यस्मात् उपलभ्यते (एतत् &URL; "
"&konqueror; मध्ये प्रविशतु, अथवा <userinput><command>khelpcenter</command> "
"< चालयन्तु पैरामीटर>सहायता:/kmouth</parameter></userinput>)।"

#: man-kmouth.1.docbook:67
#. Tag: para
